#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Employee"
msgid "Welcome. Let me show you to your seats."
msgstr "Bienvenido. Permítame mostrarle su asiento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Employee"
msgid "Right this way, please."
msgstr "Por aquí, por favor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Akiyama"
msgid "First, let's go over the basics of how to interact with a\\r\ncustomer on a date."
msgstr "Primero, vamos a repasar los conceptos básicos de como\\r\ninteractuar con un cliente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Miki"
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "Te escucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
msgctxt "572_Akiyama"
msgid "(How <Italic>do</Italic> you interact with a customer on a date...?)"
msgstr "(¿Como <Italic>tener</Italic> una buena interacción con un cliente?...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Akiyama"
msgid "You've got to act exactly the same, whether you're at the\\r\nclub or on a date."
msgstr "Tienes que actuar de la misma forma, que cuando estás en el club."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Miki"
msgid "Really? Why?"
msgstr "¿En serio? ¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Akiyama"
msgid "It would confuse the guy if you started acting differently\\r\njust because you weren't at work."
msgstr "El cliente se confundiría si empezaras a tratarlo diferente\\r\nde la nada, solo porque no estás en el trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "620_Miki"
msgid "But wouldn't that make the whole \"going on a date\" thing\\r\nseem kind of pointless?"
msgstr "Eh... ¿Pero entonces eso de \"salir en una cita\"\\r\nno quedaría en algo inútil?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "632_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I hadn't thought of that..."
msgstr "Ah, no lo había pensado..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "644_Miki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
msgctxt "656_Akiyama"
msgid "I was just kidding. Actually..."
msgstr "En verdad, solo estaba bromeando..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "668_Akiyama"
msgid "You need to be more guarded when you're out on a date with a\\r\ncustomer."
msgstr "Debes ser mucho más cautelosa cuando sales\\r\ncon un cliente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "680_Miki"
msgid "More guarded?"
msgstr "¿Más cautelosa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "692_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right. You don't want him to think he can get away\\r\nwith something just because you're not at work."
msgstr "Así es. No tienes que dejar que piense que, él puede salirse con\\r\nla suya como si nada, solo porque no estás en el trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "704_Miki"
msgid "But won't it make him feel uncomfortable if I'm on the\\r\ndefensive all the time? I mean, after he asked me out and\\r\neverything...?"
msgstr "¿Pero si estoy a la defensiva todo el tiempo, no hará\\r\nque se sienta incómodo? Después de que se\\r\ntomo la molestia de invitarme y todo eso..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "716_Akiyama"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Cierto..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "728_Miki"
msgid "And if I'm not careful, he might even stop asking for me at\\r\nthe club, too..."
msgstr "Además, si no tengo cuidado, incluso dejaría de solicitarme\\r\nen el club también..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=2
msgctxt "740_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, well, that was just a little joke. In fact, you've gotta..."
msgstr "Ah, bueno, eso en realidad solo era un chiste.\nLo que de verdad, debes hacer es..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "752_Akiyama"
msgid "You need to be more guarded when you're out on a date with a\\r\ncustomer."
msgstr "Debes ser mucho más cautelosa cuando sales\\r\ncon un cliente."

